{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Ho, drawers of iniquity.</b> The meaning: they strengthen iniquity." "<b>And like cart-ropes, sin.</b> They draw sin, and it is a noun like חטאת (sin-offering), like נושא עון ופשע וחטאה (Exodus 34:7), for it too can be the form of a noun."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:25.238568947Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}